      "content": "thanks but i dont think talking to someone is gonna fix the math. like the numbers literally don't work. i calculated it all out and even if i worked more i'd still just be digging a deeper hole. it feels less like a problem to solve and more like a cage. there's no way out of the cycle except to just... stop. does that even make sense?",
